param=param_1319,str,The Tombs of Amascut can be found in an ancient tomb south of Sophanem.<br><br>The Tombs of Amascut is a raid for 1-8 players.<br><br>The Tombs of Amascut can scale in difficulty through the use of Invocations. These Invocations change the Raid Level, with a Raid Level of less than 150 considered an Entry raid.<br><br>Attack Styles - Magic, Ranged, Melee, Special<br>Immunities - Poison, Venom<br>Slayer Categories - None
