param=param_880,str,- All non-combat skills are permanently boosted by +12.<br><br>- The boost from this Relic does not stack with any other weaker boosts but can be overwritten by a stronger one.<br><br>- When using this Relic, skills that are boosted above +12 will over time drain back to the original +12 boost.<br><br>- When using this Relic, skills that are drained below +12 will over time restore back to the original +12 boost.
