[struct_1728]
param=param_879,str,Quick Shot
param=param_880,str,- The attack speed of all Ranged weapons is halved (rounded up).<br><br>- Your ranged attacks have 100% increased accuracy against creatures and 50% increased accuracy against other players.<br><br>- Your Ranged attacks deal 10% more damage.<br><br>- You save 90% of your ammunition when firing Ranged weapons. This does not include chinchompas but does include Crystal Bow, Toxic Blowpipe and Craw's Bow charges.
param=param_884,int,2616
param=param_881,int,2664
param=param_883,int,2665
param=param_885,int,2
param=param_1274,int,3065

[struct_1729]
param=param_879,str,Fluid Strikes
param=param_880,str,- The attack speed of all melee weapons is halved (rounded up).<br><br>- Your melee attacks have 25% increased accuracy.<br><br>- You take 15% less damage from all sources.<br><br>- Your Hitpoints regenerate at a rate of 4 Hitpoints per minute instead of 1 Hitpoint per minute.
param=param_884,int,2618
param=param_881,int,2666
param=param_883,int,2667
param=param_885,int,2
param=param_1274,int,3066

[struct_1730]
param=param_879,str,Double Cast
param=param_880,str,- The attack speed of all Magic spells and weapons is halved (rounded up).<br><br>- With +60 Magic Attack Accuracy (or +20 with Regular or Elite Void Knight Mage Armour) your binding and ice spells ignore accuracy checks against creatures.<br>Otherwise, your Magic attacks have 125% increased accuracy against creatures and 50% increased accuracy against other players.<br><br>- You save 90% of your Runes when casting spells. This includes charges when using powered staves such as the Trident of the Seas, Trident of the Swamp, Sanguinesti Staff and the Enchanted Slayer Staff.
param=param_884,int,2620
param=param_881,int,2668
param=param_883,int,2669
param=param_885,int,2
param=param_1274,int,3067

[struct_1731]
param=param_879,str,Second Inventory
param=param_880,str,- Upon selecting this Relic you will receive an Extradimensional Bag which will act as a second Inventory with 28 slots.<br><br>- The Extradimensional Bag can be withdrawn from and deposited into from anywhere.<br><br>- The Extradimensional Bag can be opened so that items picked up from the ground will automatically go into it.<br><br>- Items can be withdrawn from a Bank directly into the Extradimensional Bag.<br><br>- Items cannot be used from within the Extradimensional Bag - they must still be in your Inventory.<br><br>- Existing storage items such as a Looting Bags, Herb Sacks and Rune Pouches cannot be stored inside the Extradimensional Bag.<br><br>- On death, the Extradimensional Bag is destroyed and can be reclaimed from the Sage in Lumbridge. The contents of the Extradimensional Bag are not destroyed when this happens.<br><br>- As this Relic gives you an item it must be unlocked at a Bank.
param=param_884,int,2622
param=param_881,int,2670
param=param_883,int,2671
param=param_885,int,3
param=param_1274,int,3068
param=param_1855,int,1

[struct_1732]
param=param_879,str,Treasure Seeker
param=param_880,str,- Creatures that drop Clue Scrolls have a 1/15 chance of dropping them. This also applies to Impling Jars.<br><br>- Clue Geodes, Clue Nests and Clue Bottles are found 10x more often.<br><br>- All Clue Scrolls have the lowest number of steps possible for their tier.<br><br>- Every Clue Scroll casket will roll the max amount of rewards it can give. (It can roll the same item more than once) :<br><br>   - Beginner caskets will roll 3 times.<br>   - Easy caskets will roll 4 times.<br>   - Medium caskets will roll 5 times.<br>   - Hard caskets will roll 6 times.<br>   - Elite caskets will roll 6 times.<br>   - Master caskets will roll 7 times.<br><br>- There is a chance when opening a clue casket that you will receive another casket of the same tier. This is more common the lower the casket tier.<br><br>- There is also a chance for this additional casket to be upgraded to a tier above the one you opened.
param=param_884,int,5291
param=param_1853,int,5372
param=param_1854,int,5400
param=param_881,int,5318
param=param_883,int,5345
param=param_882,int,5427
param=param_885,int,4
param=param_1274,int,3069

[struct_1733]
param=param_879,str,Unnatural Selection
param=param_880,str,- When getting a Slayer Task, you can choose which Task to receive. The same Task can be chosen repeatedly.<br><br>- Superior Slayer Creatures have a 1/25 chance of spawning.<br><br>- Superior Slayer Creatures always drop a Clue Scroll if there is one on their drop table.<br><br>- Superior Slayer Creatures now have double the number of rolls on the lesser creatures' droptable. This does not double the number of rolls on the Superior Slayer Creature's unique drop table.
