[struct_1735]
param=param_879,str,Infernal Gathering
param=param_880,str,- Upon selecting this Relic, you will receive a set of Trailblazer Tools which can be used with no requirements. The Pickaxe and Axe will do their respective skilling actions 0.6 seconds quicker than their normal tool equivalent, and the Harpoon increases Fishing speed by 1.2s. All three tools have the same bonuses as Crystal tier tools.<br><br>- Any ore mined with the Trailblazer Pickaxe will be smelted into a bar, and Smithing XP given, regardless of Smithing level.<br><br>- Any fish caught with the Trailblazer Harpoon will be cooked, and Cooking XP given, regardless of Cooking level. This will work even for fish that don't require a Harpoon to be caught if the Trailblazer Harpoon is equipped or in your Inventory.<br><br>- Any logs chopped with the Trailblazer Axe will be burned, and Firemaking XP given, regardless of Firemaking level.<br><br>- On death, these tools are lost and can be reclaimed from the Sage in Lumbridge.<br><br>- As this Relic gives you an item it must be unlocked at a Bank.
param=param_884,int,5293
param=param_1853,int,5374
