param=param_1639,str,This double-sized mould looks like two ammo moulds, roughly put together with a metal strip.<br><br>It will allow for faster production of cannonballs, giving eight balls for two bars with each use.<br><br>Requires completion of the Dwarf Cannon quest to purchase.

[struct_4336]
param=param_1636,int,27014
param=param_1638,int,300
param=param_1639,str,Grog made by Kovac. This foul-looking brew will imbue anyone who drinks it with improved knowledge of Smithing.<br><br>Smithing: +4<br>Attack: -2<br>Range: -2<br>Magic: -2

[struct_4337]
param=param_1636,int,27017
param=param_1638,int,15
param=param_1639,str,This fine powder helps smiths smelt bars. Bars made at standard furnaces using this powder will require half the amount of coal and reward twice the amount of XP. The powder will be consumed when used.

[struct_4338]
param=param_1636,int,27019
param=param_1638,int,200
param=param_1639,str,A rather heavy looking package, packed to the brim with ores and minerals.<br><br>A pack contains 30 noted ores which could be any combination of the following:<br>   Coal<br>   Iron ore<br>   Mithril ore<br>   Adamantite ore<br>   Runite ore

[struct_4339]
param=param_1636,int,27023
param=param_1638,int,4000
param=param_1639,str,A part of the Smiths Uniform. This piece of equipment provides a 20% chance to increase the speed of a Smithing action at an anvil.<br>This effect stacks when combined with other outfit pieces.<br><br>When the full set is worn, the chance increases to 100%.

