param=param_1855,int,1

[struct_4717]
param=param_879,str,Globetrotter
param=param_880,str,- You will be given a Globetrotter Pendant, which grants access to the following:<br><br>- Teleports from a fully upgraded Jewellery Box<br><br>- The following teleports from the Portal Nexus:<br><br>   - Annakarl (Demonic Ruins)<br>   - Ape Atoll<br>   - Ape Atoll Dungeon<br>   - Arceuus Library<br>   - Barbarian Outpost<br>   - Barrows<br>   - Battlefront<br>   - Camelot<br>   - Carrallanger (Graveyard of Shadows)<br>   - Catherby<br>   - Draynor Manor<br>   - East Ardougne<br>   - Falador<br>   - Fenkenstrain's Castle<br>   - Fishing Guild<br>   - Ghorrock (Frozen Waste Plateau)<br>   - Grand Exchange<br>   - Harmony Island<br>   - Ice Plateau<br>   - Kharyrll (Canifis)<br>   - Kourend Castle<br>   - Lassar (Ice Mountain)<br>   - Lumbridge<br>   - Lunar Isle<br>   - Mind Altar<br>   - Ourania<br>   - Paddewwa (Edgeville Dungeon)<br>   - Port Khazard<br>   - Salve Graveyard<br>   - Seers' Village<br>   - Senntisten (Digsite)<br>   - Teleport to House<br>   - The Forgotten Cemetery<br>   - Troll Stronghold<br>   - Trollheim<br>   - Varrock<br>   - Watchtower<br>   - Waterbirth Island<br>   - Weiss<br>   - West Ardougne<br>   - Yanille<br><br>- As this Relic gives you an item it must be unlocked at a Bank.
param=param_884,int,5286
param=param_1853,int,5367
param=param_1854,int,5395
param=param_881,int,5313
param=param_883,int,5340
param=param_882,int,5422
param=param_885,int,1
param=param_1274,int,4701
param=param_1855,int,1

[struct_4718]
param=param_879,str,Bloodthirsty
param=param_880,str,- You are able to get a Slayer Task and cancel a Slayer Task by speaking to a Slayer Master or checking your Slayer status via your Slayer Gem, Helmet, or Ring.<br><br>- Superior Slayer creatures have a 1/25 chance to appear.<br><br>- Superior Slayer creatures will give Slayer points when killed, based on their Slayer level and difficulty.<br><br>- Superior Slayer creatures now have double the number of rolls on the lesser creature's drop table. This does not double the amount of rolls on the Superior Slayer Creature's unique drop table.<br><br>- There is a 25% chance a superior monster will appear as a 'Bloodthirsty' version, with boosted offensive stats. This monster will triple the number of rolls on the lesser creature's non-unique drop table, plus a roll on its own unique drop table. They will also drop guaranteed Clue Scrolls if it is on the superior's drop table.<br><br>- Expeditious and Slaughter Bracelets will no longer consume charges and have a 35% chance to trigger, up from 25%.
param=param_884,int,5292
param=param_1853,int,5373
param=param_1854,int,5401
param=param_881,int,5319
param=param_883,int,5346
param=param_882,int,5428
param=param_885,int,4
param=param_1274,int,4702

[struct_4719]
param=param_879,str,Banker's Note
param=param_880,str,- This item will allow you to note and unnote items anywhere in Gielinor.<br><br>- You can manually use items on the Banker's Note to unnote or note them all, much like a Bank.<br><br>- The 'Activate' option allows you to note and unnote items in one action with a specified quantity. An object must first be used on the Banker's Note in order for this to work.<br><br>- You can customise how many items the Banker's note will note and unnote using the quantity options.
param=param_884,int,5977
param=param_1853,int,6058
param=param_1854,int,6086
param=param_881,int,6004
param=param_883,int,6031
param=param_882,int,6113
param=param_885,int,5
param=param_1274,int,4703
param=param_1855,int,1
param=param_2049,int,28767

[struct_4720]
param=param_879,str,Soul Stealer
param=param_880,str,- All your attacks have an increased minimum hit (10% of your max hit).<br><br>- Whenever one of your attacks successfully hits, there is a 50% chance that you will restore your Hitpoints and Prayer by 10% of the damage dealt, rounded up.<br><br>- This Relic's restore effect does not work for multi-target attacks or Special Attacks.<br><br>- This Relic's restoration effect will work with the Scythe of Vitur's initial hit, however, it will only work for its secondary hits if those hits have the same target as the initial hit. The Restoration effect will only work on the Venator bow's initial hit.
param=param_884,int,5299
param=param_1853,int,5380
param=param_1854,int,5408
param=param_881,int,5326
param=param_883,int,5353
param=param_882,int,5435
param=param_885,int,6
param=param_1274,int,4704

[struct_4721]
param=param_879,str,Weapon Master
param=param_880,str,- Every 30 seconds, your Special Attack energy is restored by 30% rather than the usual 10%.<br><br>- If you have no Special Attack energy remaining, you sacrifice 25 hitpoints for the special attack instead.<br><br>- Special Attacks are 100% accurate against monsters.<br><br>- Special Attacks have a minimum hit of 20% of your max hit.
param=param_884,int,5297
param=param_1853,int,5378
param=param_1854,int,5406
param=param_881,int,5324
param=param_883,int,5351
param=param_882,int,5433
param=param_885,int,6
param=param_1274,int,4705

[struct_4722]
param=param_879,str,Farmer's Fortune
param=param_880,str,- You will harvest patches at a rate of up to 20x per action, noting any contents you receive.<br><br>- All patches will give 3x the yield.<br><br>- Farming patches grow instantly.<br><br>- Your plants will never die.<br><br>- You have a 20%~ chance to not use a seed or sapling when planting items in patches.
param=param_884,int,5296
param=param_1853,int,5377
