[struct_4723]
param=param_879,str,Superior Sorcerer
param=param_880,str,- Magic spells and weapons with an attack speed of 4 or above have this stat halved, rounded down.<br><br>- Magic spells and weapons with an attack speed of 3 or below have this stat halved, rounded up.<br><br>- You save 90% of your Runes when casting spells. This includes charges when using powered staves such as the Trident of the Seas, Trident of the Swamp, Sanguinesti Staff, Tumeken's Shadow, and the Enchanted Slayer Staff.<br><br>- Bind spells will always hit on an unfrozen, non freeze-immune target.<br><br>- Acquire the Arcane Grimoire, which allows you to change between any Spellbooks you have unlocked. Must be at a Bank to obtain the item.<br><br>- Acquire a Rune Pouch.<br><br>- All Rune Pouches store 2 more types of Runes.<br><br>- Magic attacks will deal an additional 25% as splash damage to surrounding targets, up to 5 additional targets.<br><br>- This splash damage effect only works in multicombat areas.<br><br>- Magic accuracy is increased by 175%.<br><br>- Magic damage is increased by 20%.
param=param_884,int,5290
param=param_1853,int,5371
param=param_1854,int,5399
param=param_881,int,5317
param=param_883,int,5344
param=param_882,int,5426
param=param_885,int,3
param=param_1274,int,4707
param=param_1855,int,1

[struct_4724]
param=param_879,str,Brawler's Resolve
param=param_880,str,- Melee weapons with attack speed 4 or above have this stat halved, rounded down.<br><br>- Melee weapons with attack speed 3 or below have this stat halved, rounded up.<br><br>- 90% of charges are saved when using Melee weapons.<br><br>- Immune to all status effects, including but not limited to Poison, Venom, and Firebreath, with the exception of stuns and roots. This applies in both PvE and PvP.<br><br>- 10% Chance to deal a critical strike on a successful melee hit, dealing double damage.<br><br>- Melee accuracy is increased by 50%.<br><br>- Melee, Ranged and Magic defence is increased by 50%.
param=param_884,int,5288
param=param_1853,int,5369
param=param_1854,int,5397
param=param_881,int,5315
param=param_883,int,5342
param=param_882,int,5424
param=param_885,int,3
param=param_1274,int,4708

[struct_4725]
param=param_879,str,Archer's Embrace
param=param_880,str,- Ranged weapons with attack speed 4 or above have this stat halved, rounded down.<br><br>- Ranged weapons with attack speed 3 or below have this stat halved, rounded up.<br><br>- 90% of ammunition is saved when using Ranged weapons. This effect stacks with Ava's devices resulting in a 98% ammo saving bonus. Bow of Faerdhinen, Crystal Bow, Chinchompas and Toxic Blowpipe charges are included in this effect.<br><br>- Enchanted Bolts have a 2x boosted chance to proc.<br><br>- 10% chance that your weapon will fire an extra projectile. (Bows, Crossbows, Ballista and most thrown weapons).<br><br>- Ranged accuracy is increased by 100%.
param=param_884,int,5289
param=param_1853,int,5370
param=param_1854,int,5398
