[struct_4727]
param=param_879,str,Undying Retribution
param=param_880,str,- When you take fatal damage directly from an NPC or player, you will restore all your hitpoints and Prayer.<br><br>- Upon triggering this effect you will deal damage to all monsters or players within 3 tiles of you, assuming their south-west coordinate is within this radius. (Similar to how chinchompas and other AoE effects work). This effect will only work in the same scenarios that the Retribution Prayer would normally trigger.<br><br>- In PvM combat this damage will be equal to 200% of your Prayer level. In PvP combat this effect will be equal to 50% of your Prayer level.<br><br>- There is a 3 minute cooldown on this effect.<br><br>- Cooldown is reset on actual death.<br><br>- The damaging effect will not work on NPCs that are recoil immune, with some exceptions:<br>   - Nex<br>   - Hespori<br>   - Vorkath<br>   - All Wilderness bosses
param=param_884,int,5300
param=param_1853,int,5381
param=param_1854,int,5409
param=param_881,int,5327
param=param_883,int,5354
param=param_882,int,5436
param=param_885,int,7
param=param_1274,int,4710

[struct_4728]
param=param_879,str,Guardian
param=param_880,str,- This item will allow you to summon a powerful <col=#>Guardian Thrall</col>, lasting 30 minutes.<br><br>- The guardian will attack your target with whatever style it is weak to.<br><br>- When you are in multi-combat it will cast an AoE attack if the target is weak to range or magic.<br><br>- The Guardian's stats are:<br>   - Min hit: 5<br>   - Max hit: 13<br>   - Attack Speed: 4<br>   - Accuracy: 45000<br><br>- The Guardian does not work in PvP.<br><br>- This perk will also work inside The Gauntlet.
