[struct_6443]
param=param_879,str,Hotfoot
param=param_880,str,While the <col=#>Searing boots</col> are worn, you gain the following benefits:<br><br>- <col=#>Agility</col> experience is gained based on your <col=#>Agility</col> level while you run.<br><br>- Caught fish are automatically cooked.<br><br>- Mined ore is automatically smelted.<br><br>Additionally, regardless of your footwear:<br><br>- Picking up some <col=#>Termites</col> or a <col=#>Mark of grace</col> from a course will automatically complete the lap granting completion XP and 10,000 <col=#>coins</col>.<br><br>- <col=#>Marks of grace</col> will always have a 33% chance to spawn on all rooftop courses.<br><br>- Completing a course grants two completion count and 25% bonus experience.<br><br>- 100% success rate on all actions for <col=#>Agility</col> and <col=#>Cooking</col>.<br><br>- You will receive 2x <col=#>Termites</col> from the Colossal Wyrm Agility Course.<br><br>- You will receive 10x <col=#>Crystal shards</col> from Prifddinas Agility Course.
param=param_884,int,8158
param=param_1853,int,8239
param=param_1854,int,8266
param=param_881,int,8185
param=param_883,int,8212
param=param_882,int,8293
param=param_885,int,1
param=param_1855,int,1
param=param_2049,int,28771

[struct_6444]
param=param_879,str,Larcenist
param=param_880,str,You will gain the following benefits while <col=#>Thieving</col>:<br>- 100% success rate on all actions.<br>- You will automatically re-pickpocket an NPC.<br>- You will automatically re-steal from a stall.<br>- Items obtained from pickpocketing and stalls are noted.<br>- Stalls never deplete and guards will never catch you thieving them.<br>- The amount of coin pouches you can carry is increased by 10x.<br><br>Additionally, while <col=#>Thieving</col> loot is increased by 10x for the following:<br>- Pickpocketing.<br>- Stealing from stalls.<br>- Stealing house valuables in Varlamore.
param=param_884,int,8168
param=param_1853,int,8249
param=param_1854,int,8276
param=param_881,int,8195
param=param_883,int,8222
param=param_882,int,8303
param=param_885,int,4
param=param_1855,int,0

[struct_6445]
param=param_879,str,Abundance
param=param_880,str,- All non-combat skills are permanently boosted by 10.<br><br>- Every time you receive an XP drop, gain an additional 2 XP in the same skill. This is affected by the League Passive XP modifier.<br><br>- For every XP gained, gain 2x as many coins. These can go either to your bank or inventory if there is room, which can be toggled above.
param=param_884,int,8157
