param=param_1855,int,0
param=param_2574,int,16146

[struct_6446]
param=param_879,str,Transmute
param=param_880,str,The high alchemy and low alchemy spells transform into two new spells:<br><br>- <col=#>Alchemic Divergence</col>: Upgrades up to 10 of a resource into a higher tier.<br>- <col=#>Alchemic Convergence</col>: Downgrades up to 10 of a resource into a lower tier.<br><br>Both spells cost no runes and have no level requirement. The spell gives 10 <col=#>Magic</col> XP for each item transmuted (before league XP multipliers).<br><br> The <col=#>Transmutation ledger</col> can be equipped and acts as an infinite source of <col=#>Nature runes</col>.<br><br>Using items on the <col=#>Transmutation ledger</col> will display what they can turn into.<br><br>When cast upon a noted item, these spells will automatically re-cast over time as long as the items are available in the same slot in your inventory.<br><br>You can still cast alchemy spells via the toggle above or by configuring the spells in your spellbook. Normal Alchemy spells will not automatically re-cast and will only cost 1 <col=#>Nature rune</col>.<br><br>List of Transmutable resources: <br><br>- Hides<br>- Runes<br>- Ashes<br>- Uncut gems<br>- Compost<br>- Seeds (Cactus)<br>- Seeds (Hardwood tree)<br>- Seeds (Fruit tree)<br>- Seeds (Tree)<br>- Seeds (Bush)<br>- Seeds (Hops)<br>- Seeds (Herbs)<br>- Seeds (Flower)<br>- Seeds (Allotment)<br>- Logs (Normal)<br>- Logs (Pyre)<br>- Mining (Normal)<br>- Mining (Crafting)<br>- Bones<br>- Raw Fish
param=param_884,int,8166
param=param_1853,int,8247
param=param_1854,int,8274
param=param_881,int,8193
param=param_883,int,8220
param=param_882,int,8301
param=param_885,int,3
param=param_1855,int,1
param=param_2049,int,33229
param=param_2574,int,16148

[struct_6447]
param=param_879,str,Soul Harvest
param=param_880,str,While harvesting any farming crop, or when NPCs would drop bones or ashes, you will instead harvest stackable <col=#>Soul shards</col>.<br><br><col=#>Soul shards</col> can be used for the following:<br>- They can be used in place of <col=#>Pure essence</col> while training <col=#>Runecraft</col>.<br>- 100 can be sacrificed at the <col=#>Libation bowl</col> at the <col=#>Teomat</col> for 550 <col=#>Prayer</col> XP (before league multipliers) without requiring <col=#>Libation wine</col>.<br><br>You will receive 1 shard per 4 base <col=#>Farming</col> XP granted while harvesting or checking health while farming, this is not multiplied by the leagues XP multiplier.<br><br>You will receive more shards for higher tier bones and ashes roughly equal to the bone shard equivalent for that tier of item.
param=param_884,int,8164
param=param_1853,int,8245
param=param_1854,int,8272
param=param_881,int,8191
param=param_883,int,8218
param=param_882,int,8299
param=param_885,int,4
param=param_1855,int,0
param=param_2574,int,16145

[struct_6448]
param=param_879,str,Butler's Bell
param=param_880,str,When the bell is rung, a <col=#>Demon butler</col> will be summoned to work for you. The butler's work will continue even if you are offline.<br><br>The butler can gather the following resources for you:<br>- Mining ores (8 per minute)<br>- Catching fish (14 per minute)<br>- Chopping logs (10 per minute)<br>- Picking flax (50 per minute)<br>- Farming herbs (10 per minute)<br><br>Additionally, the butler can also process these gathered items for you but at half the rates listed above:<br>- Ores into bars<br>- Raw fish into cooked fish<br>- Logs into planks<br>- Flax into bowstrings<br>- Herbs into unfinished potions<br><br>When the <col=#>Demon butler</col> processes resources for you, he will share a 10 XP (before League XP multipliers) with you in the relevant production skill per resource.
param=param_884,int,8165
param=param_1853,int,8246
param=param_1854,int,8273
param=param_881,int,8192
param=param_883,int,8219
param=param_882,int,8300
param=param_885,int,3
param=param_2049,int,33237
