param=param_882,int,8297
param=param_885,int,2
param=param_1855,int,1
param=param_2049,int,33233

[struct_6451]
param=param_879,str,Culling Spree
param=param_880,str,When you are assigned a <col=#>Slayer</col> task you will be able to choose from three different options. You will also be able to choose how many you wish to slay (5-200).<br><br>Where possible, at least one of the choices will be a boss slayer task.<br><br>Additionally you gain the following bonuses while on a <col=#>Slayer</col> task.<br>- Upon slaying a superior slayer monster, there is a 50% chance that another will spawn.<br>- Superior slayer creatures will always drop 1-3 <col=#>Clue scroll (elite)</col>.<br>- You will gain all of the the effects of a <col=#>Slayer helmet (i)</col> without needing to wear one.<br>- You can purchase any of the slayer reward store perks for free.<br>- The <col=#>Rune pouch</col>, <col=#>Herb sack</col> and <col=#>Looting bag</col> will be purchasable for free from the slayer reward store.
param=param_884,int,8169
param=param_1853,int,8250
param=param_1854,int,8277
param=param_881,int,8196
param=param_883,int,8223
param=param_882,int,8304
param=param_885,int,5

[struct_6452]
param=param_879,str,Conniving Clues
param=param_880,str,When opening a <col=#>Reward casket</col>, you have a 1/3 chance to receive <col=#>Clue contracts</col> which can be consumed to teleport to your current clue step.<br><br>- Beginner clues give 0-2 contracts at a time<br>- Easy clues give 1-4 contracts at a time<br>- Medium clues give 1-5 contracts at a time<br>- Hard clues give 1-7 contracts at a time<br>- Elite clues give 1-9 contracts at a time<br>- Master clues give 1-10 contracts at a time<br><br><col=#>Reward caskets</col> also have a 1/4 chance to contain a clue scroll box of the same tier.<br><br>- Clues from creatures and impling jars now have a drop rate of 1/15.<br><br>- Clue vessels obtained from skilling (such as clue geodes and clue nests) are 10x more likely to drop.<br><br>- All clues have the lowest possible number of steps, and will give the maximum amount of reward rolls.<br><br>- Emote, Falo & Charlie Clue steps no longer have item requirements.
param=param_884,int,8172
param=param_1853,int,8253
param=param_1854,int,8280
param=param_881,int,8199
param=param_883,int,8226
param=param_882,int,8307
param=param_885,int,3
param=param_1855,int,0

[struct_6453]
param=param_879,str,Flow State
param=param_880,str,The following actions all occur at a rate of 1.2 seconds (2 cycles) rather than their usual speed:<br><br>- <col=#>Mining</col> any rock.<br><br>- <col=#>Woodcutting</col> any tree.<br><br>- <col=#>Fishing</col> from any fishing spot.<br><br>- <col=#>Cooking</col> any food.<br><br>- <col=#>Firemaking</col> any logs or adding to a bonfire.<br><br>- Offering bones at a <col=#>Prayer</col> altar.<br><br>- <col=#>Fletching</col> the following items:<br>   - Regular & Atlatl arrows<br>   - Bruma Roots<br>   - Unstrung bows<br>   - Shields<br>   - Stocks<br>   - Javelins<br>   - Battlestaves<br>   - Hunter spears<br>   - Redwood hiking staffs<br><br>- <col=#>Smithing</col> the following items:<br>   - Smelting ores<br>   - Smithing bars<br>   - Making cannonballs<br><br>- <col=#>Crafting</col> the following items:<br>   - Glassblowing<br>   - Leather crafting<br>   - Pottery<br>   - Gold/Silver items<br>   - Spinning wheel<br><br>- The following <col=#>Farming</col> interactions:<br>   - Harvesting herbs<br>   - Harvesting allotments<br>   - Planting seeds<br><br>- Casting the following <col=#>Magic</col> spells:<br>   - Low & high alchemy<br>   - Superheat<br>   - Alchemic divergence & convergence (if unlocked)<br><br>- Additionally the following interactions in minigames will be sped up:<br>   - Wintertodt Roots and Brazier lighting<br>   - Tempoross fishing<br>   - Stealing Valuables<br><br>This effect stacks with the <col=#>Fletching knife</col> and <col=#>Diabolical worms</col>.
param=param_884,int,8174
param=param_1853,int,8255
param=param_1854,int,8282
param=param_881,int,8201
param=param_883,int,8228
param=param_882,int,8309
param=param_885,int,6

[struct_6454]
param=param_879,str,Flask of Fervour
param=param_880,str,When the Flask is consumed:<br>- Your <col=#>Hitpoints</col> will be restored to full.<br>- Your <col=#>Prayer</col> points will be restored to full.<br>- Your special attack energy will be restored to full.<br><br>Over the next 2.4 seconds the sigil will:<br>- Trigger three explosions which deal 60% of your base <col=#>Prayer</col> level (30% in PvP) to all enemies within 3 tiles of you as typeless damage.<br>- Reduce all damage you take to 0.<br>- Not deal damage to <col=#>Yama</col>.<br><br>This item has a base cooldown of 3 minutes<br>- For every 10 damage you deal in a single hit reduce the cooldown 0.6s.<br><br>- This perk will also work inside The Gauntlet.
param=param_884,int,8177
